      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While a counselor cannot instantly revive or replace your own drive, they can provide a safe space to untangle the performative components of your life and address this deep sense of exhaustion. Sometimes, individuals do not need someone to \"fix\" the engine, but rather guidance to help them decide what truly matters before continuing to drive a car they no longer own. It is entirely okay to step back and explore whether you need to redesign your identity or simply take space away from the roles you are currently playing.",
      "source": "target",
